    "content": "All 26 checklist items have been executed and recorded — coverage is complete.\n\n**Summary: 20 PASS / 6 FAIL**\n\nCore browsing, template selection, form filling, previewing (Markdown + plain text), favorites, filtering/sorting, suggestions, copy-to-clipboard, custom submission and localStorage persistence all work.\n\nKey defects found:\n- **FT-10** — Search has no fuzzy/typo tolerance (\"resme\", \"meetng\" → 0 results, no suggestions).\n- **CS-14 / CS-19** — Email-format field accepts an invalid value with no error, and the preview gate only checks non-blankness, so generation proceeds with invalid data.\n- **CS-17** — Markdown special characters in field values are neither rejected nor escaped, so user input can alter the generated document structure.\n- **CS-27** — No placeholder↔field consistency check at submission; a template with mismatched keys was accepted and previews render unresolved `{{placeholders}}`.\n- **CS-29** — Duplicate field labels are accepted and share one key, so the fields are not independently fillable (typing in one mirrors into the other) and console errors appear."
